      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HANNAH GOANNA (1) continued her winning form with another strong run after running them ragged to make it two on the bounce, scoring at this track over 300m (17.05). The one to beat again. VERSIFICATION (8) turned in a plain performance last time when fifth at this track over 411m behind Last Rupee (24.25) in a Grade 4/5. Expected to feature in the finish. CONFETTI DAN (2) was never in contention last time after missing the jump at Grafton, but prior to that won by 1.3 lengths at Grafton (20.19) beating Miss Pollywood in a Grade 5 on October 16. A big run wouldn't surprise.",
